33	
34	    /**
35	     * Formats an owner's membership number as {@code "<customerCode>-M<YY>"}, where
36	     * {@code YY} is the last two digits of the registration date's year
37	     * (e.g. {@code "LON-SMI-0007-M26"}). Returns {@code null} until both the customer code
38	     * and registration date have been assigned.
